at at the back of the pack, apparently unaware that Lightbody had barely finished second in a heat of the 400 to " [:a {:href "/athletes/79575"} "Nigel Barker"] ", thus possessing great finishing speed.  With about 200 metres remaining, Lightbody took the lead and there was no chance for anyone to catch him.  McGough closed just as rapidly, however, to take second place."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Number"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "R1"] [:th {} "Final"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {:class "bib"} "370"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/78697"} "Jim Lightbody"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/USA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/USA.png"}] "USA"]] [:td {} "4:19.4 (1 h1)"] [:td {} "4:12.0 (1)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {:class "bib"} "428"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/69294"} "John McGough"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/GBR"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/GBR.png"}] "GBR"]] [:td {} "4:18.8 (1 h2)"] [:td {} "4:12.6 (2)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "3"] [:td {:class "bib"} "253"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/76190"} "Kristian Hellström"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/SWE"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/SWE.png"}] "SWE"]] [:td {} "– (2 h1)"] [:td {} "4:13.4 (3)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Bronze"} "Bronze"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "4"] [:td {:class "bib"} "726"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/79577"} "Dad Wheatley"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/AUS"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px;